# LF is the canonical line ending in this repository, in the index and in the
# working tree. Every tracked file is text; the code runs in Linux containers.
#
# Without this, a checkout's line endings depend on each machine's core.autocrlf,
# and any tool that writes LF into a CRLF working tree turns the whole file into a
# diff with no content change. jobbers/runners/scheduler_proc.py was committed that
# way once already (121 lines "changed", none of them different).
* text=auto eol=lf
